<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Atalanta 1 (Inzaghi 85th minute) Inter 1 (Djorkaeff 44).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>Lazio 2 (Protti 26, Casiraghi 61) Parma 1 (Baggio 65th). 1-0.</p>
<p>40,000</p>
<p>Milan 3 (Weah 1 and 73, Baggio 79) Perugia 0. 1-0. 47,000</p>
<p>Piacenza 1 (Luiso 44) Vicenza 0. 1-0. 12,000</p>
<p>Reggiana 1 (Valencia 78) Roma 1 (Tommasi 6). 0-1. 15,000</p>
<p>Sampdoria 0 Napoli 1 (Beto 73). 0-0. 24,000</p>
<p>Udinese 2 (Bia 5, Bierhoff 16) Bologna 2 (Marocchi 37, Nervo</p>
<p>83). 2-1. 20,000</p>
<p>Verona 2 (Bisoli 32 - own-goal, Binotto 49) Cagliari 2 (Silva</p>
<p>6, Cozza 34). 1-2. 15,000</p>
<p>Add first division summaries: Juventus 1 (Padovano 8) Fiorentina 0. 1-0. 35,000</p>
</text>
